  "description": "y applies linear elementwise over a (over [x]) and over b (over [y]): neither one's index sets contain the other's, so the lift refuses y (array_shape_mismatch). z alone could be lifted, but when the lift refuses any right-hand side flatten leaves every equation as written (esm-spec 9.6.11), and the build refuses it."
 },
